---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Your Field Guide Is Ready — Finding the Right Words" description="Read or download your free Finding the Right Words Field Guide.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Your Field Guide is ready</p>
      <h1>Here Is Your Field Guide</h1>
      <p class="sub">Start reading right now, or download the PDF to keep. We&rsquo;ve also sent the link to your inbox.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="actions" aria-label="Open your Field Guide">
      <a class="btn primary" href="/fieldguide/">Read the Field Guide</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/fieldguide/fieldguide.pdf" download>Download the PDF</a>
    </section>

    <section class="mail" aria-label="We emailed you too">
      <div class="badge" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D8C58C" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2.5"/><path d="M4 7l8 6 8-6"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>We&rsquo;ve emailed you the link too</h2>
        <p>So you have a copy to come back to whenever you need it. If it isn&rsquo;t in your inbox within a few minutes, check your spam or promotions folder, or write to us at <a href="mailto:support@edenmethod.com">support@edenmethod.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <section class="signoff">
      <p>The Field Guide maps the framework. When you&rsquo;re ready to practice it on real clinical moments, the <a href="/">Practice Program</a> is where it becomes yours.</p>
      <p class="warm">Warmly,</p>
      <p class="name">David Feinstein, PhD</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style>
    .wrap{max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.25rem}
    .hero{text-align:center;padding:3.4rem 0 .4rem}
    .eyebrow{font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.76rem;color:var(--brass-deep);margin:0 0 .9rem}
    .hero h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);font-size:2.55rem;line-height:1.14;margin:0 auto .9rem;max-width:14ch}
    .hero .sub{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.45;margin:0 auto;max-width:36ch}
    @media(max-width:560px){ .hero{padding:2.4rem 0 .2rem} .hero h1{font-size:1.95rem;max-width:none} .hero .sub{font-size:1.1rem} }

    .actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.8rem;justify-content:center;margin:2rem 0 .4rem}
    .btn{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;font-family:var(--ui);font-weight:700;font-size:1.02rem;padding:.9rem 1.7rem;border-radius:10px;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s}
    .btn.primary{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
    .btn.primary:hover{background:#17304a;color:#fff}
    .btn.ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--navy);border:1.5px solid var(--line)}
    .btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--navy)}

    .mail{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(15,35,51,.06);padding:1.6rem;margin:2.2rem 0 .4rem;display:flex;gap:1.15rem;align-items:flex-start}
    .mail .badge{flex:0 0 52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .mail .badge svg{width:26px;height:26px;display:block}
    .mail h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);font-size:1.4rem;margin:.1rem 0 .4rem;line-height:1.2}
    .mail p{margin:0;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1rem}
    @media(max-width:560px){ .mail{padding:1.3rem;gap:.9rem} .mail .badge{flex-basis:44px;height:44px} .mail .badge svg{width:22px;height:22px} .mail h2{font-size:1.22rem} }

    .rule{height:1px;background:var(--line);border:0;max-width:720px;margin:2.6rem auto 0}
    .signoff{text-align:center;padding:2.6rem 0 .4rem}
    .signoff p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1.08rem;max-width:42ch;margin:0 auto 1.3rem}
    .signoff a{color:var(--brand)}
    .signoff .warm{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;color:var(--ink);font-size:1.1rem;margin:0}
    .signoff .name{font-family:var(--serif);color:var(--navy);font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:500;margin:.1rem 0 0}
  </style>
</Base>
